      {
        "id": "p5-q10-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$(x+4)^3$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x^3+12x^2+48x+64$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(x+4)^3&=(x+4)(x^2+8x+16)\\\\(x+4)^3&=x^3+8x^2+16x+4x^2+32x+64\\\\(x+4)^3&=x^3+12x^2+48x+64\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q10-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$(x+y+z)^2-2(xy+yz+zx)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x^2+y^2+z^2$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(x+y+z)^2-2(xy+yz+zx)&=x^2+2x(y+z)+(y+z)^2-2(xy+yz+zx)\\\\(x+y+z)^2-2(xy+yz+zx)&=x^2+2xy+2xz+y^2+2yz+z^2-2xy-2yz-2zx\\\\(x+y+z)^2-2(xy+yz+zx)&=x^2+y^2+z^2\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q10-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$(x+y-z)(x-y+z)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x^2-y^2-z^2+2yz$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(x+y-z)(x-y+z)&=[x+(y-z)][x-(y-z)]\\\\(x+y-z)(x-y+z)&=x^2-(y-z)^2\\\\(x+y-z)(x-y+z)&=x^2-y^2+2yz-z^2\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q10-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$(a+b+c)(a^2+b^2+c^2-ab-bc-ca)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$a^3+b^3+c^3-3abc$",
          "worked": "Expanding the three contributions separately gives:\n$$\\begin{align*}a(a^2+b^2+c^2-ab-bc-ca)&=a^3+ab^2+ac^2-a^2b-abc-a^2c\\\\b(a^2+b^2+c^2-ab-bc-ca)&=a^2b+b^3+bc^2-ab^2-b^2c-abc\\\\c(a^2+b^2+c^2-ab-bc-ca)&=a^2c+b^2c+c^3-abc-bc^2-ac^2\\end{align*}$$\nAdding these and collecting like terms:\n$$\\begin{align*}(a+b+c)(a^2+b^2+c^2-ab-bc-ca)&=a^3+b^3+c^3-3abc\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 48
      }
